# The bundled font binaries are produced by apps/android/tools/fetch-fonts.sh.
# Lora and IBM Plex Sans carry Reserved Font Names, so they can only ship
# unsubset (about 1.6 MB together); they stay out of the APK and download on
# first use instead, which keeps the committed set at 2.4 MB, under the 3 MB
# budget. Every other bundled family is committed.
/src/main/assets/fonts/bundled/lora*.ttf
/src/main/assets/fonts/bundled/ibm-plex-sans*.ttf
